{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/extras/7939a9f6a0604c15c38c2745a823db16.avif?t=1769115930\" width=920 height=259 /></span>ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Untold Memories: Potter\u2019s Field</strong> is a cinematic psychological horror game built around themes of guilt, memory, and redemption.<br>Years ago, Mark caused the death of a young child in a tragic accident. Since that night, his life has been consumed by silence.<br>Living alone in a small apartment, he struggles under the weight of his past and the burden of survival.<br>Debts grow, time runs out... and just as everything begins to collapse, a mysterious job offer changes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By accepting it, Mark unknowingly opens the door to his own nightmare.<br>Buried memories begin to resurface not just to remind him, but to demand retribution. <br>Some memories never stay buried...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/extras/dba336afd9a1f7ddb749e44f22afa98b.poster.avif?t=1769115930\" width=920 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/extras/dba336afd9a1f7ddb749e44f22afa98b.webm?t=1769115930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/extras/dba336afd9a1f7ddb749e44f22afa98b.mp4?t=1769115930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 Experience an intense story of guilt and punishment where dreams and reality slowly intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Storytelling</strong> \u2013 Explore Mark\u2019s fractured mind through detailed environments, dynamic lighting, and immersive sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Experience</strong> \u2013 See the world through Mark\u2019s eyes, uncover hidden fragments of his past, and witness the slow unraveling of his reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong> \u2013 Wander through abandoned places, uncover symbolic objects, and piece together the traces of a forgotten tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Narrative</strong> \u2013 Every sound, every silence, and every flicker of light pulls Mark deeper into the darkness of his conscience and closer to the truth he\u2019s been running from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/extras/c98005eb021bcb0adf95cf609af9665e.poster.avif?t=1769115930\" width=920 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/extras/c98005eb021bcb0adf95cf609af9665e.webm?t=1769115930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/extras/c98005eb021bcb0adf95cf609af9665e.mp4?t=1769115930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954970?t=1769115930","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954970?t=1769115930","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/e8bdb79a5ac7c121a4fe360ef9801b287bbfc981/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769115930","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/e8bdb79a5ac7c121a4fe360ef9801b287bbfc981/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769115930","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achi